{
    "title": "PGA TOUR Golf Shootout",
    "description": "Want to level up your golf game? Sink birdies and ace the greens in PGA TOUR\u00ae GOLF SHOOTOUT! \r\n\r\nPlay your friends on stunning real-life TPC golf courses from the PGA TOUR!\r\n\r\nPlay friends 1v1 or enter a golf tournament!\r\n\r\nTee up to collect and upgrade golf clubs and participate in daily challenges and tournaments for exciting rewards!\r\n\r\nSimple controls. Fun and easy to learn.\r\n\r\n<b>Golf against your friends!</b>\r\n\r\nPlay with your friends on real-life PGA TOUR golf courses with over 85 holes!\r\n- Golf against your friends in versus mode \r\n- Challenge your friends and enter a golf tournament\r\n- Join or start your own club house and invite your friends\r\n\r\n<b>Golfing for Everyone! - The Perfect Golf Game for Casual Playing</b>\r\n\r\nSmooth, simple controls for easy-to-learn golf gameplay\r\n- Tackle new challenges in single player or challenge friends\r\n- Golf against top players from around the world\r\n\r\n<b>Collectable Clubs!</b>\r\n\r\nDiscover and upgrade over 50 golf clubs with unique stats and abilities to improve your golf game\r\n- Progress, unlock, and upgrade golf clubs\r\n- Unlock golf clubs with special powers\r\n- Daily challenges and rewards\r\n- Beat your friends with your upgraded clubs and golf skills\r\n\r\n<b>Swing with the Best!</b>\r\n\r\nCompete with opponents around the world in Versus mode or advance through single player\r\n- Rise up the leaderboards and challenge the world's top golfers\r\n- Enter tournaments and become a PGA TOUR champion\r\n\r\n<b>Gorgeous Graphics!</b>\r\n\r\nPlay on real-life PGA TOUR TPC golf courses with stunning views!\r\n- Play on 5 gorgeous courses with over 85 holes\r\n- Practice your golf swing with amazing 3D graphics\r\n- Intuitive golf gameplay that is out of this world\r\n\r\n<b>KEY FEATURES:</b>\r\n\r\n- Play against real opponents around the world in Versus mode\r\n- Progress through challenging TPC golf courses in single player\r\n- Daily challenges and rewards\r\n- Unlock and upgrade golf clubs\r\n- Beautiful 3D graphics \r\n\r\n\r\nStart your golf career now and join a worldwide community of players\r\n\r\nPGA TOUR Golf Shootout is the perfect app to up your golf game\r\n\r\nUnlimited golfing. Download now for free!\r\n\r\nA network connection is required to play this golfing game",
    "descriptionHTML": "Want to level up your golf game? Sink birdies and ace the greens in PGA TOUR\u00ae GOLF SHOOTOUT! <br><br>Play your friends on stunning real-life TPC golf courses from the PGA TOUR!<br><br>Play friends 1v1 or enter a golf tournament!<br><br>Tee up to collect and upgrade golf clubs and participate in daily challenges and tournaments for exciting rewards!<br><br>Simple controls. Fun and easy to learn.<br><br><b>Golf against your friends!</b><br><br>Play with your friends on real-life PGA TOUR golf courses with over 85 holes!<br>- Golf against your friends in versus mode <br>- Challenge your friends and enter a golf tournament<br>- Join or start your own club house and invite your friends<br><br><b>Golfing for Everyone! - The Perfect Golf Game for Casual Playing</b><br><br>Smooth, simple controls for easy-to-learn golf gameplay<br>- Tackle new challenges in single player or challenge friends<br>- Golf against top players from around the world<br><br><b>Collectable Clubs!</b><br><br>Discover and upgrade over 50 golf clubs with unique stats and abilities to improve your golf game<br>- Progress, unlock, and upgrade golf clubs<br>- Unlock golf clubs with special powers<br>- Daily challenges and rewards<br>- Beat your friends with your upgraded clubs and golf skills<br><br><b>Swing with the Best!</b><br><br>Compete with opponents around the world in Versus mode or advance through single player<br>- Rise up the leaderboards and challenge the world&#39;s top golfers<br>- Enter tournaments and become a PGA TOUR champion<br><br><b>Gorgeous Graphics!</b><br><br>Play on real-life PGA TOUR TPC golf courses with stunning views!<br>- Play on 5 gorgeous courses with over 85 holes<br>- Practice your golf swing with amazing 3D graphics<br>- Intuitive golf gameplay that is out of this world<br><br><b>KEY FEATURES:</b><br><br>- Play against real opponents around the world in Versus mode<br>- Progress through challenging TPC golf courses in single player<br>- Daily challenges and rewards<br>- Unlock and upgrade golf clubs<br>- Beautiful 3D graphics <br><br><br>Start your golf career now and join a worldwide community of players<br><br>PGA TOUR Golf Shootout is the perfect app to up your golf game<br><br>Unlimited golfing. Download now for free!<br><br>A network connection is required to play this golfing game",
